### Crear aviso de mantenimiento por odómetro (noticeId null = crear) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/saveNoticeByOdometer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noticeId": null,
  "unitId": 1,
  "notificationEmails": "taller@ejemplo.com;supervisor@ejemplo.com",
  "maintenanceLineId": 1,
  "maintenanceRangeId": 1,
  "interval": 5000,
  "nextEvent": 55000,
  "message": "Servicio mayor cada 5,000 km",
  "noticeTypeId2": 1
}

### Actualizar aviso existente (noticeId con valor) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/saveNoticeByOdometer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noticeId": 1,
  "unitId": 1,
  "notificationEmails": "taller@ejemplo.com",
  "maintenanceLineId": 1,
  "maintenanceRangeId": 1,
  "interval": 10000,
  "nextEvent": 60000,
  "message": "Servicio mayor cada 10,000 km (actualizado)",
  "noticeTypeId2": 1
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/saveNoticeByOdometer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noticeId": null,
  "unitId": 1,
  "notificationEmails": "taller@ejemplo.com",
  "interval": 5000,
  "nextEvent": 55000,
  "message": "Servicio mayor",
  "noticeTypeId2": 1
}

### Validación: interval con tipo inválido → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/saveNoticeByOdometer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noticeId": null,
  "unitId": 1,
  "notificationEmails": "taller@ejemplo.com",
  "interval": "no-numerico",
  "nextEvent": 55000,
  "message": "Servicio mayor",
  "noticeTypeId2": 1
}
